.TH tkmonthcanvas n 0.5 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkmonthcanvas \- calendar canvas (month/quarter/year, themes, multi-day selection)
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkmonthcanvas
.br
::tkutils::tkmonthcanvas::init ?options?
.br
::tkutils::tkmonthcanvas::drawMonth canvas year month
.SH DESCRIPTION
Procedural toolkit that draws month, quarter and year calendars onto a Tk canvas,
with themes (default/dark/light), click callbacks (day/week/month) and
none|single|multiple day selection. Date and holiday logic come from the tical
engine, so this is an optional widget (not in the tkutils umbrella). See
docs/tkmonthcanvas.md for the full API.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tical(n), tkutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, calendar, canvas
